@startuml 支付确认序列图
' ==========================================
' 心理学被试招募平台 - 序列图2：支付确认
' 成员3：系统建模
' ==========================================

title 序列图2：报酬支付确认

actor "被试" as Subject
actor "研究者" as Researcher
participant "小程序/Web" as Client
participant "后端API\n(Spring Boot)" as API
database "MySQL\n数据库" as DB

== 实验完成，触发支付 ==

Researcher -> Client: 点击"标记实验完成"
activate Client
Client -> API: POST /api/signin/complete\n{experimentId}
activate API
API -> DB: UPDATE registrations\nSET is_completed=1\nWHERE experiment_id=#{id}
API -> DB: INSERT INTO payment_records\n(registration_id, payer_user_id, payee_user_id,\n amount, status=PENDING)
activate DB
DB --> API: 支付记录创建成功
deactivate DB
API --> Client: {"code": 200, "data": {"paymentId": xxx}}
deactivate API
Client --> Researcher: 显示"实验完成\n已创建支付记录"
deactivate Client

== 被试上传收款码 ==

API -> Subject: 推送通知"请上传收款码"

Subject -> Client: 进入收款码上传页面
activate Client
Subject -> Client: 选择"微信支付"\n上传收款码图片
Client -> API: POST /api/payment/codes\n{paymentType, qrCodeImage}
activate API
API -> DB: INSERT INTO payment_codes\n(user_id, payment_type, qr_code_url)
activate DB
DB --> API: 收款码保存成功
deactivate DB
API --> Client: {"code": 200, "message": "收款码上传成功"}
deactivate API
Client --> Subject: 显示"上传成功"
deactivate Client

== 研究者查看并支付 ==

API -> Researcher: 推送通知"被试已上传收款码"

Researcher -> Client: 查看支付记录列表
activate Client
Client -> API: GET /api/payment/records\n?status=PENDING
activate API
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM payment_records\nLEFT JOIN payment_codes
activate DB
DB --> API: 返回支付记录+收款码
deactivate DB
API --> Client: 返回列表
deactivate API
Client --> Researcher: 显示被试收款码
deactivate Client

note over Researcher: **线下扫码支付**\n使用微信/支付宝扫码转账

== 研究者确认支付 ==

Researcher -> Client: 上传支付截图\n点击"标记已支付"
activate Client
Client -> API: POST /api/payment/records/confirm-payer\n{paymentId, screenshot}
activate API
API -> DB: UPDATE payment_records\nSET status=PAID,\npayer_confirmed_at=NOW(),\npayment_screenshot_url=screenshot
activate DB
DB --> API: 更新成功
deactivate DB
API -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\n(user_id=被试, type=PAYMENT_RECEIVED)
DB --> API: 通知创建成功

API --> Client: {"code": 200, "message": "已标记支付"}
deactivate API
Client --> Researcher: 显示"已标记支付"
deactivate Client

== 被试确认收款 ==

API -> Subject: 推送通知"研究者已支付"

Subject -> Client: 查看支付记录
activate Client
Client -> API: GET /api/payment/records/{registrationId}
activate API
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM payment_records
DB --> API: 返回支付记录（含截图）
API --> Client: 返回支付详情
deactivate API
Client --> Subject: 显示支付截图\n"请确认是否收到款项"
deactivate Client

alt 确认收到款项
    Subject -> Client: 点击"确认收款"
    activate Client
    Client -> API: POST /api/payment/records/confirm-payee\n{paymentId}
    activate API
    API -> DB: UPDATE payment_records\nSET status=CONFIRMED,\npayee_confirmed_at=NOW()
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 更新成功
    deactivate DB
    API -> API: **触发双向评价流程**\n创建评价提醒通知
    API -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\n(type=REVIEW_REQUIRED)\n发送给双方
    API --> Client: {"code": 200, "data": {"status": "CONFIRMED"}}
    deactivate API
    Client --> Subject: 显示"收款确认成功\n请评价本次实验"
    deactivate Client

else 未收到/有异议
    Subject -> Client: 点击"发起争议"
    activate Client
    Subject -> Client: 填写争议理由\n上传证据截图
    Client -> API: POST /api/payment/records/dispute\n{paymentId, reason, evidenceUrls}
    activate API
    API -> DB: UPDATE payment_records\nSET status=DISPUTED
    activate DB
    DB --> API: 更新成功
    deactivate DB
    API -> DB: INSERT INTO appeals\n(appellant_id, appeal_type=PAYMENT_DISPUTE,\ntarget_id, reason, evidence_urls, status=PENDING)
    DB --> API: 申诉记录创建
    API -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\n(user_id=管理员, type=NEW_APPEAL)
    API --> Client: {"code": 200, "message": "争议已提交"}
    deactivate API
    Client --> Subject: 显示"争议已提交\n等待管理员处理"
    deactivate Client
end

@enduml
